# =============================================================================
# Samou' Go — API endpoint selection
# =============================================================================
# The HTTP client lives in @samou-go/api-client (packages/api-client/src/api.ts),
# so this theme shares its resolution order with every other web app:
#   1. VITE_API_BASE_URL   (base host; /api/v1 appended if missing)
#   2. VITE_API_URL        (legacy: full URL, verbatim)
#   3. LAN fallback        http://192.168.0.111:4000 (built-in, no .env needed)
# On boot the client logs which one it picked. Set only ONE variable.
#
# Case 1 — LAN dev: nothing to set; the built-in fallback is the LAN IP.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.0.111:4000
#
# Case 2 — ngrok tunnel (cellular testing, API local): add the same origin to
# packages/api/.env CORS_ORIGINS. Free ngrok URLs rotate every session.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://abcd-12-34-56-78.ngrok-free.app
#
# Case 3 — deployed API (Render/Neon):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://samougo-api.onrender.com
#
# Legacy full-URL form (rarely needed):
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4000/api/v1
# =============================================================================
